#. ja: わ、私は…<br>いったい…なぜ…？
#. de: Was<nbsp>... für ein Albtraum<nbsp>...
#. fr: Pourquoi...<nbsp>? Pourquoi moi...<nbsp>?
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "NpcYell:6553:0:13"
msgid "Why...?<br>Why did he...?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: あ、あぁ…
#. de: Endlich<nbsp>... frei ...
#. fr: Enfin... libre...
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "NpcYell:6554:0:13"
msgid "Release.<br>At last."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 嗚呼、光が…見える…
#. de: Das Licht<nbsp>... Ich kann es sehen<nbsp>...
#. fr: L-la lumière... Elle m'appelle...
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "NpcYell:6555:0:13"
msgid "The light.<br>I can see..."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 父さん…母さん…<br>これで、やっと…
#. de: Vater<nbsp>... Mutter<nbsp>... Endlich darf ich zu euch kommen<nbsp>...
#. fr: Père... Mère... Nous nous retrouverons... dans l'autre monde...
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "NpcYell:6556:0:13"
msgid "Mother. Father.<br>I come to you now..."
msgstr ""

#. ja: テオドリック…<br>許すまじ…
#. de: Theoderic<nbsp>... In den sieben Höllen sollst du schmoren<nbsp>...
#. fr: Theodoric... Brûle dans les sept enfers...
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "NpcYell:6557:0:13"
msgid "Theodoric...<br>The Hells burn for you..."
msgstr ""

#. ja: △▽、○×□☆◇○ーー！！
#. de: △▽, ○×□☆◇○!!
#. fr: ▼＃☆＠Ψ<nbsp>!
