msgid "Desertion is punishable<br>by death! <i>My</i> death!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: あわ、あわわわわ！<br>ど、どうすれば…
#. de: Ojemine, was mach ich denn jetzt bloß?
#. fr: Oh, non<nbsp>! Mais comment je vais faire sans mon familier<nbsp>?<nbsp>...
